{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>預計Game Infomer將帶來《GTA6》新一輪消息，希望這裏面能有遊戲中動態的天氣系統、動植物羣落，還有邁阿密和佛羅裏達如何成為本作獨特氛圍的靈感來源的報道。</p>\n<p>《GTA6》將於11月19日發售。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》將是GI雜誌新封面 更多細節和截圖將曝光\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260926/1790425351_103031.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》將是GI雜誌新封面 更多細節和截圖將曝光\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260926/1790425351_870667_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>《GTA6》將於11月19日發售。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》將是GI雜誌新封面 更多細節和截圖將曝光\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260926/1790425351_103031.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T14:58:08.468011+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}